```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Admin opens Quotes section /quotes] --> B[GET /api/quotes with filters]
    B --> B1[Default: excludes archived + discarded]
    B1 --> C[QuotesTable - status filter + debounced search + pagination]
    C --> D{Admin action?}
    D -->|Click quote| E[QuoteDetail with TimelineStatus]
    D -->|Filter by status| F[Update filters, re-fetch]
    D -->|Search| F2[Debounced search, reset to page 1]
    F --> B
    F2 --> B

    E --> G[Show calculated timeline from timestamps]
    G --> G1[quote_sent_at]
    G --> G2[accepted_at]
    G --> G3[rejected_at]
    G --> G4[paid_at]

    D -->|Cotizar| H[PresentQuoteModal - price, lead time, delivery date]
    H --> I[PATCH /api/quotes/:id/present]
    I --> I1[Generate PDF via pdfkit]
    I1 --> I2[Upload to Supabase Storage]
    I2 --> I3[Send email with PDF + accept/reject magic links]

    D -->|Archivar| J[PATCH /api/quotes/:id/archive]
    J --> J1[Quote moves to archived - disappears from main table]

    subgraph Archived["/quotes/archived"]
        AR1[Admin navigates to Archived section]
        AR1 --> AR2[GET /api/quotes?status=archived with q + page]
        AR2 --> AR3[ArchivedQuotesTable - search + pagination]
    end

    subgraph Pagination["Search & Pagination (all tables)"]
        P1[Debounced search input - 300ms]
        P2[Prev/Next buttons - disabled at boundaries]
        P3[20 records per page]
        P4[Buttons disabled when total <= pageSize]
    end

    style Archived fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#7b1fa2
    style Pagination fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32
```
